              "value": "Desert Wind"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(air, arcane, concentrate, evocation)\n\nFrequency: 3/day\n\nThe dragon calls upon the desert wind. This has the same effect as gust of wind (37 Fortitude) but in a 60-foot cone. A creature that fails its save is also blinded until the end of its next turn (or for 1 minute on a critical failure)."
            },
